  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds ICookieStorageService, a typed async cookie storage service with configurable CookieStorageOptions (expiration, path, domain, SameSite, secure), alongside the existing localStorage and sessionStorage support. Includes typed async API, result-based reads, bulk operations, change notifications, key prefixing, and configurable service lifetimes.",
